1024:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****  ===============================================================================
1025:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to manage the UART asynchronous
1026:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     and Half duplex data transfers.
1027:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c **** 
1028:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) There are two mode of transfer:
1029:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****        (+) Blocking mode: The communication is performed in polling mode.
1030:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            The HAL status of all data processing is returned by the same function
1031:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            after finishing transfer.
1032:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****        (+) Non-Blocking mode: The communication is performed using Interrupts
1033:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            or DMA, These API's return the HAL status.
1034:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            The end of the data processing will be indicated through the
1035:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            dedicated UART IRQ when using Interrupt mode or the DMA IRQ when
1036:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            using DMA mode.
1037:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            The HAL_UART_TxCpltCallback(), HAL_UART_RxCpltCallback() user callbacks
1038:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            will be executed respectively at the end of the transmit or Receive process
1039:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****            The HAL_UART_ErrorCallback()user callback will be executed when a communication error is
1040:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c **** 
1041:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Blocking mode API's are :
1042:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Transmit()
1043:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Receive()
1044:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c **** 
1045:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Non-Blocking mode API's with Interrupt are :
1046:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Transmit_IT()
1047:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Receive_IT()
1048:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_IRQHandler()
1049:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c **** 
1050:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) Non-Blocking mode API's with DMA are :
1051:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Transmit_DMA()
1052:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_Receive_DMA()
1053:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_DMAPause()
1054:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_DMAResume()
1055:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_DMAStop()
1056:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c **** 
1057:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) A set of Transfer Complete Callbacks are provided in Non_Blocking mode:
1058:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_TxHalfCpltCallback()
